<title>USA: Ocean City BOE, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</title>
<headline>Ocean City BOE, N.J., won by Commerce Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-10-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Commerce Capital said it won $2.418 million of Ocean City Board of Education, N.J., school bonds, with a lowest rate of 4.70, highest price of 100.084.</p>
</text>
